WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.434
In tutorial 5.3, you'll follow one
keyword ladder: which pages are live,

00:00:11.484 --> 00:00:13.512
where they rank, and what comes next.

00:00:14.562 --> 00:00:19.187
First, find the ladder's card on your
Pipeline: the climb, the main keyword,

00:00:19.237 --> 00:00:23.127
the pages in the top 10, the
next step, and its credits.

00:00:23.177 --> 00:00:24.754
Click its name to open it.

00:00:25.739 --> 00:00:30.069
At the top, you see the main keyword's
place on Google, the pages live,

00:00:30.119 --> 00:00:32.759
the pages in the top 10, and the clicks.

00:00:34.193 --> 00:00:37.268
The climb shows every
rung, a step of the ladder,

00:00:37.318 --> 00:00:41.734
from the easiest page to the main
page, and what state each page is in.

00:00:43.214 --> 00:00:48.366
Click a page for its details: where it ranks
over time, and a link to the live page.

00:00:50.718 --> 00:00:55.518
Then follow Position on Google over
time. Each line is the main keyword,

00:00:55.568 --> 00:00:57.295
or the best page of a rung.

00:00:58.693 --> 00:01:02.768
Clicks from Google and Times shown
on Google add your visits and views,

00:01:02.818 --> 00:01:08.047
with a marker for each page you published,
each fix, and each search engine update.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:13.350
Next, the Timeline shows what
happened so far, and, below Today,

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.314
what comes next in the weeks ahead.

00:01:17.031 --> 00:01:21.553
Did publishing these pages help compares
each page's move with the rest of your

00:01:21.553 --> 00:01:26.206
website over the same weeks. Each
page gets a label, like Likely helped,

00:01:26.256 --> 00:01:27.768
or Too early to tell.

00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:33.099
Finally, Reports of this ladder lists
its plan, the pages written for it,

00:01:33.149 --> 00:01:36.949
and the weekly rank checks.
Click one to open its report,

00:01:36.999 --> 00:01:38.886
with the page ready to download.

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:44.470
Now you can see, week by week, which
pages are live, where each one ranks,

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.412
and what comes next for this keyword.

00:01:47.865 --> 00:01:52.915
So: open the ladder, see the climb,
follow positions, read what happens next,

00:01:52.965 --> 00:01:55.168
see what helped, and open its reports.

00:01:56.162 --> 00:02:00.512
You know where your ladder stands.
Next, approve or skip what is coming up,

00:02:00.562 --> 00:02:02.398
in tutorial 5.4.
